The first official update/bugfix kit was submitted to
Bill Randle (moderator, comp.sources.games).  Look for
it in his newsgroup.

Please note:  The update kit contains diffs which were
cut off the release version.  If you have modified some
files, store them and put in their place the original
release files before applying the kit's diffs.

We are gratified by the nice response to 3.0.  Thanks for
the bugs notifications you mailed us.  Please keep
hunting them down.

The next update will be posted in about two weeks.

For the development team,

